Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,New menu item? Hide it under a cloth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.06,0:00:05.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,Your visitor grabs the hem and pulls it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:08.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,Let go early, and the cloth drops back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.63,0:00:11.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,Pull past a third, and it lifts away on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.87,0:00:16.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,Underneath sits the maple pear galette, with its price and a reserve button.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:20.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,A tap works too, so phone visitors get the reveal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:23.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,Grab the free code at vaelolab.com/lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.77,0:00:26.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,Send this to the baker launching something new this week!
